.SS "uint32_t csmp::CSMP_ElementSpecifications::FaceNodeForElementOfType (int8_t etype, uint32_t face, uint32_t face_node)\fR [static]\fP"
Returns the number of the node that is the n'th node of a particular face of the supplied element type as specified by \fBCSMP_FEM_TYPE\fP enumeration, see \fBFiniteElement\&.h\fP

.PP
Use this method to retrieve this information before any finite elements have been built\&. 
.SS "uint32_t csmp::CSMP_ElementSpecifications::InterpolationOrder (const std::string & etype)\fR [static]\fP"
Method deduces order of element interpolation functions from the input finite-element type\&.
.SH "Input Arguments"
.PP
The CSMP type name of the finite element that shall be queried\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
the interpolation order is returned as an unsigned integer value: 1 = linear, 2 = quadratic, 3 = cubic\&. 
.RE
.PP

